Not covered by this licence:

- The sound recordings. They are not in this repo; scripts/make_sounds.py
  downloads them from Freesound. Each keeps its own licence (CC0, CC BY 3.0 or
  CC BY 4.0), listed with its author in sounds/sources.md.
- The MediaPipe hand landmarker model, downloaded by scripts/hand3d.py on first
  run. It is Google's, under the Apache License 2.0.
- 3D models by other people that I printed, such as the horns hand ("hand
  gestures" by lukino_maker3d on MakerWorld, CC BY-NC-SA). Their files are not
  in this repo; get them from the designers' own pages.
